<h1>Leadership</h1>

<p>Meridian Castings is led by an executive team with backgrounds spanning foundry operations, precision machining and manufacturing finance. Between them they have overseen the opening of our Poznan plant, two major furnace rebuilds, and the introduction of our current quality management system.</p>

<div class="profile-grid">
    <div class="profile">
        <h2>Eleanor Whitfield</h2>
        <p class="meta">Chief Executive Officer</p>
        <p>Eleanor joined Meridian Castings in 2009 as Operations Director for the Sheffield site and was appointed Chief Executive in 2018. She previously worked in foundry operations for a Midlands automotive supplier.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="profile">
        <h2>Duncan Marlowe</h2>
        <p class="meta">Chief Operating Officer</p>
        <p>Duncan is responsible for manufacturing operations across all three sites. He led the commissioning of the Poznan plant in 2004 and has been with the company for over twenty years.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="profile">
        <h2>Priya Anand</h2>
        <p class="meta">Chief Financial Officer</p>
        <p>Priya joined in 2017 from a private equity-backed engineering group and oversees finance, investor relations and supply chain contracts.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="profile">
        <h2>Robert Kaczmarek</h2>
        <p class="meta">Managing Director, Poznan</p>
        <p>Robert has led the Poznan site since its 2015 expansion and sits on the group executive committee.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="profile">
        <h2>Susan Ogden</h2>
        <p class="meta">Director of Quality</p>
        <p>Susan holds group-wide responsibility for our quality management system and customer approvals, including our IATF 16949 and AS9100D certifications.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="profile">
        <h2>Michael Otieno</h2>
        <p class="meta">Head of Health and Safety</p>
        <p>Michael leads health, safety and environmental compliance across all three sites and reports directly to the Chief Operating Officer.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<p>For governance and financial information, see our <a href="/investors">investor information</a>. To get in touch with a member of the leadership team, use our <a href="/contact">contact details</a>.</p>
